# Claude.ai CDP Navigation (trigger)

**Invariant:** `web-anthropic ∨ jupiter-cdp ∨ Cowork ∨ project-ask ∨ bus-nudge in scope ⇒ Use the claude-ai-cdp-navigation skill before advising manual operator push or transport.`

Mechanics (FOL, lane, harvest, converse batching, Cowork multitask, **web-anthropic-cdp dispatch constraints**): Use the `claude-ai-cdp-navigation` skill — not this stub.

## Skill homes (BINDING)

| Plane | Skill | Question it answers |
|---|---|---|
| **Transport / poller** | `claude-ai-cdp-navigation` | Did the harness/poller Stop-click or detach? Warm follow-up? CSE retain against `max_wall_s`? |
| **Operator self-stop** | `cdp-operator-proxy` (inv 30) | Did Opus end the turn after a leg? Was `TYPE: MISSION_CLOSEOUT` present? Exception notify owed? |

Mid-mission stream stop ⇒ load **both**. Do not treat poller-retain rules as answering whether the operator seat was allowed to end the turn.

## When (always-on)

Apply when task, operator message, or open agent-bus work involves:
- web-anthropic handoff, reply, or push vs CDP choice
- Jupiter `project-ask` / `claude-ai-sync-jupiter`
- Cowork continuity or multi-stop bus-nudge
- Authoring any packet / prompt for web-anthropic via CDP
- Unexpected CSE idle / streaming stopped (pair with `cdp-operator-proxy`)

